# ---- never publish: secrets, personal data, local machine state
# (see SECURITY.md and CONTRIBUTING.md)
.sensitive-patterns
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
*.cer
*.crt
*.token
secrets.*
credentials*.json
*.log
*.log.[0-9]*
